<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="bn">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>স্মার্ট উপজেলা - সুপার এডমিন</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Hind+Siliguri:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/crypto-js/4.1.1/crypto-js.min.js"></script>
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Hind Siliguri', sans-serif; background-color: #f1f5f9; }
        .hidden-custom { display: none !important; }
        .sidebar-item { transition: all 0.2s; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 4px; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; }
        .sidebar-item:hover, .sidebar-item.active { background-color: #dcfce7; color: #166534; font-weight: bold; }
        .card { background: white; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; }
        
        aside { transition: width 0.3s ease-in-out; }
        .menu-text, .section-title, .logo-text { transition: opacity 0.2s ease-in-out; opacity: 1; }
        aside.collapsed .menu-text, 
        aside.collapsed .section-title,
        aside.collapsed .logo-text { display: none; opacity: 0; }
        aside.collapsed .sidebar-item { justify-content: center; }
        aside.collapsed { width: 5rem !important; } 
        
        th { text-align: left; padding: 12px; background: #f8fafc; color: #475569; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e8f0; }
        td { padding: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9; font-size: 0.9rem; vertical-align: middle; }
        tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
        tr:hover { background-color: #f8fafc; }
        
        .cat-btn.active, .cat-trans-btn.active { background-color: #2563eb; color: white; border-color: #2563eb; }
        
        .modal { transition: opacity 0.3s ease-in-out; }
        .modal-content { transform: scale(0.95); transition: transform 0.3s ease-in-out; }
        .modal.open .modal-content { transform: scale(1); }
        
        .custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 6px; }
        .custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: #f1f1f1; }
        .custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #cbd5e1; border-radius: 10px; }
        .custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: #94a3b8; }

        .activity-icon { width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 14px; }

        .chat-bubble { max-width: 75%; padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 0.9rem; position: relative; word-wrap: break-word; }
        .chat-user { background-color: #f3f4f6; color: #1f2937; border-bottom-left-radius: 2px; }
        .chat-admin { background-color: #2563eb; color: white; border-bottom-right-radius: 2px; margin-left: auto; }
        .chat-list-item.active { background-color: #eff6ff; border-left: 4px solid #2563eb; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="text-gray-800 h-screen overflow-hidden flex flex-col">

<!-- SECURITY ALERT BANNER -->
<div id="security-alert" class="hidden-custom bg-red-600 text-white text-center py-2 px-4 text-sm font-bold z-[200] shadow-lg animate-pulse">
    <i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation mr-2"></i> SECURITY ALERT: অবৈধ ডাটা বা সাসপিসিয়াস অ্যাক্টিভিটি ডিটেক্ট করা হয়েছে! দয়া করে ইউজার লিস্ট চেক করুন।
</div>

<div class="flex-1 flex overflow-hidden">

    <!-- 1. LOGIN SCREEN -->
    <div id="admin-login" class="fixed inset-0 bg-slate-900 z-[100] flex items-center justify-center">
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-2xl w-96 text-center">
            <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-green-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-user-shield text-4xl text-green-600"></i>
            </div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-1">এডমিন প্যানেল</h2>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mb-6">স্মার্ট উপজেলা ম্যানেজমেন্ট সিস্টেম</p>
            
            <input type="email" id="adm-email" placeholder="ইমেইল" class="w-full bg-gray-50 border p-3 rounded-lg mb-3 focus:outline-green-500">
            <input type="password" id="adm-pass" placeholder="পাসওয়ার্ড" class="w-full bg-gray-50 border p-3 rounded-lg mb-6 focus:outline-green-500">
            
            <button onclick="adminLogin()" id="btn-login" class="w-full bg-green-600 text-white font-bold py-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-green-700 transition shadow-lg flex justify-center items-center gap-2">
                লগইন
            </button>
            <p id="login-msg" class="text-red-500 text-xs mt-3 hidden"></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 2. SIDEBAR -->
    <aside id="main-sidebar" class="w-64 bg-white border-r flex flex-col z-10 h-full shadow-lg transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="p-6 border-b flex justify-between items-center" ondblclick="toggleSidebar()">
            <h1 class="text-xl font-bold text-green-700 flex items-center gap-2 overflow-hidden whitespace-nowrap">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-map-location-dot text-2xl"></i> 
                <div class="logo-text">
                    <span>স্মার্ট উপজেলা</span>
                    <p class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 font-normal">এডমিন ড্যাশবোর্ড</p>
                </div>
            </h1>
            <button onclick="toggleSidebar()" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-green-700 focus:outline-none" title="Toggle Menu">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-bars"></i>
            </button>
        </div>
        
        <nav class="flex-1 p-4 overflow-y-auto custom-scrollbar">
            <div onclick="switchTab('dashboard')" id="menu-dashboard" class="sidebar-item active p-3 cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-3">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-chart-line w-5 text-center"></i> <span class="menu-text">ড্যাশবোর্ড</span>
            </div>
            
            <p class="section-title text-xs font-bold text-gray-400 mt-4 mb-2 uppercase px-3">অ্যাকশন এরিয়া</p>
            <div onclick="switchTab('verification')" id="menu-verification" class="sidebar-item p-3 cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-3 relative">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-certificate w-5 text-center"></i> <span class="menu-text">ভেরিফিকেশন রিকোয়েস্ট</span>
                <span id="badge-verify" class="hidden absolute right-2 bg-red-500 text-white text-[10px] px-1.5 rounded-full">0</span>
            </div>
            
            <div onclick="switchTab('outside-nid')" id="menu-outside-nid" class="sidebar-item p-3 cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-3 relative text-blue-700">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-id-card-clip w-5 text-center"></i> <span class="menu-text font-bold">বহিরাগত NID রিভিউ</span>
                <span id="badge-outside-nid" class="hidden absolute right-2 bg-red-500 text-white text-[10px] px-1.5 rounded-full">0</span>
            </div>
            
            <div onclick="switchTab('chat')" id="menu-chat" class="sidebar-item p-3 cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-3 relative">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-comments w-5 text-center"></i> <span class="menu-text">লাইভ চ্যাট / সাপোর্ট</span>
                <span id="badge-chat" class="hidden absolute right-2 bg-blue-500 text-white text-[10px] px-1.5 rounded-full">New</span>
            </div>
            <div onclick="switchTab('reports')" id="menu-reports" class="sidebar-item p-3 cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-3 relative">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation w-5 text-center"></i> <span class="menu-text">রিপোর্টস</span>
                <span id="badge-report" class="hidden absolute right-2 bg-red-500 text-white text-[10px] px-1.5 rounded-full">0</span>
            </div>

            <p class="section-title text-xs font-bold text-gray-400 mt-4 mb-2 uppercase px-3">সার্ভিস ও ডাটা</p>
            <div onclick="switchTab('notices')" id="menu-notices" class="sidebar-item p-3 cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-3">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-bullhorn w-5 text-center"></i> <span class="menu-text">নোটিশ বোর্ড</span>
            </div>
            
            <!-- NEW: Notes Moderation Tab -->
            <div onclick="switchTab('notes_mod')" id="menu-notes_mod" class="sidebar-item p-3 cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-3 text-pink-700 bg-pink-50 border border-pink-100">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-note-sticky w-5 text-center"></i> <span class="menu-text font-bold">নোটস (24H Story)</span>
            </div>

            <div onclick="switchTab('contest')" id="menu-contest" class="sidebar-item p-3 cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-3 text-purple-700">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-trophy w-5 text-center"></i> <span class="menu-text font-bold">প্রতিযোগিতা (Contest)</span>
            </div>
            <div onclick="switchTab('services')" id="menu-services" class="sidebar-item p-3 cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-3">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group w-5 text-center"></i> <span class="menu-text">সেবা (পর্যটন/শিক্ষা)</span>
            </div>
            <div onclick="switchTab('transport')" id="menu-transport" class="sidebar-item p-3 cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-3">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-bus w-5 text-center"></i> <span class="menu-text">পরিবহন (Transport)</span>
            </div>
            <div onclick="switchTab('directory')" id="menu-directory" class="sidebar-item p-3 cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-3 relative">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-address-book w-5 text-center"></i> <span class="menu-text">ডিরেক্টরি</span>
                <span id="badge-dir-sidebar" class="hidden absolute right-2 bg-red-500 text-white text-[10px] px-1.5 rounded-full animate-pulse">0</span>
            </div>
            <div onclick="switchTab('market')" id="menu-market" class="sidebar-item p-3 cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-3">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-shop w-5 text-center"></i> <span class="menu-text">হাট ও বাজার</span>
            </div>
            <div onclick="switchTab('blood')" id="menu-blood" class="sidebar-item p-3 cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-3">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-heart-pulse w-5 text-center"></i> <span class="menu-text">রক্তদাতা তালিকা</span>
            </div>
            <div onclick="switchTab('emergency')" id="menu-emergency" class="sidebar-item p-3 cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-3">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-bell w-5 text-center"></i> <span class="menu-text">জরুরি এলার্ট</span>
            </div>
            
            <p class="section-title text-xs font-bold text-gray-400 mt-4 mb-2 uppercase px-3">ম্যানেজমেন্ট</p>
            <!-- নতুন ইউজার ট্র্যাকিং মেনু যুক্ত করা হলো -->
            <div onclick="switchTab('tracking')" id="menu-tracking" class="sidebar-item p-3 cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-3 text-teal-700 bg-teal-50 border border-teal-100">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-shoe-prints w-5 text-center"></i> <span class="menu-text font-bold">ইউজার ট্র্যাকিং লগ</span>
            </div>
            <div onclick="switchTab('users')" id="menu-users" class="sidebar-item p-3 cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-3">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-users w-5 text-center"></i> <span class="menu-text">ইউজার লিস্ট (All)</span>
            </div>
            <div onclick="switchTab('verified_users')" id="menu-verified_users" class="sidebar-item p-3 cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-3">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-user-check w-5 text-center"></i> <span class="menu-text">ভেরিফাইড ইউজার</span>
            </div>
            <div onclick="switchTab('tourists')" id="menu-tourists" class="sidebar-item p-3 cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-3">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-plane-departure w-5 text-center"></i> <span class="menu-text">ট্যুরিস্ট ইউজার</span>
            </div>

            <!-- Account Deletion Requests Menu -->
            <div onclick="switchTab('account-delete')" id="menu-account-delete" class="sidebar-item p-3 cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-3 relative text-red-700">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-user-xmark w-5 text-center"></i> <span class="menu-text font-bold">একাউন্ট ডিলিট রিকোয়েস্ট</span>
                <span id="badge-account-delete" class="hidden absolute right-2 bg-red-500 text-white text-[10px] px-1.5 rounded-full">0</span>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Trash Bin / Deleted Posts -->
            <div onclick="switchTab('trash')" id="menu-trash" class="sidebar-item p-3 cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-3 relative text-orange-700 bg-orange-50">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-trash-can w-5 text-center"></i> <span class="menu-text font-bold">ট্র্যাশ বিন (Trash)</span>
                <span id="badge-trash" class="hidden absolute right-2 bg-orange-500 text-white text-[10px] px-1.5 rounded-full">0</span>
            </div>

            <div onclick="switchTab('monetization')" id="menu-monetization" class="sidebar-item p-3 cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-3 relative">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-sack-dollar w-5 text-center"></i> <span class="menu-text">মনিটাইজেশন</span>
                <span id="badge-withdraw" class="hidden absolute right-2 bg-green-500 text-white text-[10px] px-1.5 rounded-full" title="New Withdrawal Requests">0</span>
            </div>
            <div onclick="switchTab('ads')" id="menu-ads" class="sidebar-item p-3 cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-3">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-rectangle-ad w-5 text-center"></i> <span class="menu-text">বিজ্ঞাপন (Ads)</span>
            </div>
            <div onclick="switchTab('posts')" id="menu-posts" class="sidebar-item p-3 cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-3">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-newspaper w-5 text-center"></i> <span class="menu-text">পোস্ট মডারেশন</span>
            </div>
            <div onclick="switchTab('complaints')" id="menu-complaints" class="sidebar-item p-3 cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-3">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-inbox w-5 text-center"></i> <span class="menu-text">অভিযোগ বক্স</span>
            </div>
            
            <div onclick="switchTab('push_notifications')" id="menu-push_notifications" class="sidebar-item p-3 cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-3 bg-purple-50 text-purple-700 font-bold border border-purple-100">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-bell w-5 text-center"></i> <span class="menu-text">Push Notifications</span>
            </div>

            <p class="section-title text-xs font-bold text-gray-400 mt-4 mb-2 uppercase px-3">সেটিংস</p>
            <div onclick="switchTab('locations')" id="menu-locations" class="sidebar-item p-3 cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-3">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-map w-5 text-center"></i> <span class="menu-text">এলাকা সেটআপ</span>
            </div>
             <div onclick="switchTab('settings')" id="menu-settings" class="sidebar-item p-3 cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-3">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-gear w-5 text-center"></i> <span class="menu-text">অ্যাপ সেটিংস</span>
            </div>
        </nav>

        <div class="p-4 border-t bg-gray-50">
            <button onclick="adminLogout()" class="w-full bg-white border border-red-200 text-red-50 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-bold hover:bg-red-50 transition flex items-center justify-center gap-2 overflow-hidden">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-right-from-bracket"></i> <span class="menu-text">লগআউট</span>
            </button>
        </div>
    </aside>

    <!-- 3. MAIN CONTENT -->
    <main class="flex-1 overflow-y-auto p-8 bg-slate-50 relative custom-scrollbar">
        
        <!-- DASHBOARD TAB -->
        <div id="tab-dashboard" class="space-y-6 animate-fade">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800">ওভারভিউ</h2>
                <button onclick="loadRecentActivity()" class="text-sm bg-white border px-3 py-1 rounded shadow-sm hover:bg-gray-50 text-blue-600"><i class="fa-solid fa-rotate-right"></i> রিফ্রেশ</button>
            </div>
            
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
                <div onclick="switchTab('users')" class="card p-6 border-l-4 border-blue-500 flex items-center gap-4 cursor-pointer hover:shadow-md transition">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-blue-100 flex items-center justify-center text-blue-600 text-xl"><i class="fa-solid fa-users"></i></div>
                    <div><p class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase">মোট ইউজার</p><h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800" id="count-users">...</h3></div>
                </div>
                <div onclick="switchTab('posts')" class="card p-6 border-l-4 border-green-500 flex items-center gap-4 cursor-pointer hover:shadow-md transition">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-green-100 flex items-center justify-center text-green-600 text-xl"><i class="fa-solid fa-newspaper"></i></div>
                    <div><p class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase">মোট পোস্ট</p><h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800" id="count-posts">...</h3></div>
                </div>
                <div onclick="switchTab('verification')" class="card p-6 border-l-4 border-yellow-500 flex items-center gap-4 cursor-pointer hover:shadow-md transition">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-yellow-100 flex items-center justify-center text-yellow-600 text-xl"><i class="fa-solid fa-certificate"></i></div>
                    <div><p class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase">ভেরিফিকেশন</p><h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800" id="count-verify">0</h3></div>
                </div>
                <div onclick="switchTab('chat')" class="card p-6 border-l-4 border-purple-500 flex items-center gap-4 cursor-pointer hover:shadow-md transition">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-purple-100 flex items-center justify-center text-purple-600 text-xl"><i class="fa-solid fa-comments"></i></div>
                    <div><p class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase">সাপোর্ট চ্যাট</p><h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800">Live</h3></div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Storage Usage Display -->
            <div class="card p-6 bg-slate-800 text-white rounded-xl shadow-lg flex justify-between items-center bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-800 to-slate-700">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-slate-600 rounded-full flex justify-center items-center text-2xl text-blue-400">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-hard-drive"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-1">স্টোরেজ ও ডাটাবেস ইউজেস</h3>
                        <p class="text-xs text-gray-300">Images, Posts & User Data (Estimated)</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="text-right">
                    <div class="w-48 md:w-64 bg-slate-600 h-3 rounded-full overflow-hidden mt-2 relative border border-slate-500">
                        <div class="bg-blue-400 h-full w-[35%] rounded-full"></div>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-xs mt-2 text-gray-300"><span class="font-bold text-white">35%</span> ব্যবহৃত হয়েছে (Approx.)</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- RECENT ACTIVITY SECTION -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
                <div class="lg:col-span-2 card p-0 overflow-hidden">
                    <div class="p-4 border-b bg-gray-50 flex justify-between items-center">
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-700"><i class="fa-solid fa-clock-rotate-left mr-2"></i> সাম্প্রতিক অ্যাক্টিভিটি</h3>
                        <span class="text-xs text-gray-400">সর্বশেষ আপডেট</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="overflow-x-auto">
                        <table class="w-full">
                            <thead class="bg-white">
                                <tr>
                                    <th class="pl-6">ধরন</th>
                                    <th>বিবরণ</th>
                                    <th>সময়</th>
                                    <th class="text-right pr-6">একশন</th>
                                </tr>
                            </thead>
                            <tbody id="activity-log-list" class="divide-y">
                                <tr><td colspan="4" class="text-center py-6 text-gray-400">লোডিং অ্যাক্টিভিটি...</td></tr>
                            </tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="card p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 to-white">
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4">কুইক শর্টকাট</h3>
                    <div class="space-y-3">
                        <button onclick="switchTab('notices')" class="w-full bg-white p-3 rounded shadow-sm border text-left flex items-center gap-3 hover:bg-blue-50 transition">
                            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i></div>
                            <span class="font-bold text-sm">নোটিশ দিন</span>
                        </button>
                        <button onclick="switchTab('users')" class="w-full bg-white p-3 rounded shadow-sm border text-left flex items-center gap-3 hover:bg-green-50 transition">
                            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded bg-green-100 text-green-600 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fa-solid fa-user-plus"></i></div>
                            <span class="font-bold text-sm">নতুন ইউজার খুঁজুন</span>
                        </button>
